{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-023",
    "title": "顾氏旧债"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_123",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "叶观澜推开后墙木板，露出一条向下的石阶。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "雪原的夜比山门更冷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3839,
          "end": 3839
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临、顾长离和叶观澜沿山脊走了两日，终于在一处背风的岩洞里停下。第三盏灯的青光时隐时现，始终在他们前方十里之外。每当陆照临试图靠近，灯光便向后退，像故意保持一段无法追上的距离。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3841,
          "end": 3841
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜在洞口布下三道铜线：“今晚不能再走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3843,
          "end": 3843
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“追兵呢？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3845,
          "end": 3845
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗的人被雪雾困住了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3847,
          "end": 3847
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们会追上来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3849,
          "end": 3849
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以你要尽快学会使用残印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3851,
          "end": 3851
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向两枚灰白石片。它们被分开放在岩石两端，彼此之间隔着一条细缝。掌心残印与石片相触时，会产生短暂共鸣，却无法完整拼合。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3853,
          "end": 3853
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不会法术。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3855,
          "end": 3855
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“残印不是法术。”叶观澜说，“它借的是灵脉，不是你的气海。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3857,
          "end": 3857
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“代价？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3859,
          "end": 3859
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你已经知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3861,
          "end": 3861
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想起老槐树的树冠，想起父亲斗篷的颜色。那些记忆像被雪覆盖的脚印，仍在，却越看越模糊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3863,
          "end": 3863
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离点燃一小撮灰叶。灰叶没有火焰，只发出淡蓝色的烟。烟气绕着两枚残印旋转，最后汇成一条细线。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3865,
          "end": 3865
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“闭眼，听灯声。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3867,
          "end": 3867
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临照做。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3869,
          "end": 3869
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "起初，他只听见风。风穿过岩洞，撞在石壁上，像无数人在低声说话。渐渐地，风声中出现了灯罩碰撞的节奏，一声、两声、三声，随后停下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3871,
          "end": 3871
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三声之后，灵气从地面涌入他的脚底。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3873,
          "end": 3873
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "那不是温暖的灵气，而是一股带着冰霜的寒流。寒流沿经脉向上，经过膝、腹、胸口，最后在眉心汇成一点青光。陆照临本能地想把它压回气海，叶观澜却按住他的肩。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3875,
          "end": 3875
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“别收。让它经过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3877,
          "end": 3877
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“会伤到经脉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3879,
          "end": 3879
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你若只守气海，永远打不开第二道门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3881,
          "end": 3881
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临咬牙承受。青光经过胸口时，眼前忽然浮出雪地影像。年幼的自己站在老槐树下，陆沉舟把一盏空灯放到他手里。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3883,
          "end": 3883
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记住第三盏灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3885,
          "end": 3885
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它为什么没有火？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3887,
          "end": 3887
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为火会让它找到你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3889,
          "end": 3889
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "影像中的陆沉舟抬头看向屋檐，那里挂着一串铜片。铜片上刻着三个名字：陆、顾、叶。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3891,
          "end": 3891
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想伸手看清最后一个字，影像却突然碎裂。青光冲入眉心，他整个人向后倒去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3893,
          "end": 3893
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离将他扶住：“停下！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3895,
          "end": 3895
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临睁开眼，耳边嗡鸣不止。他看见岩洞里多了一盏灯，灯罩内的火焰是白色的。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3897,
          "end": 3897
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那不是我们的灯。”叶观澜拔刀。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3899,
          "end": 3899
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "白灯悬在半空，火焰里浮出一行字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3901,
          "end": 3901
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“金丹之前，不可开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3903,
          "end": 3903
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离问：“谁写的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3905,
          "end": 3905
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“太虚遗脉。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3907,
          "end": 3907
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临撑起身体：“它为什么提醒我们？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3909,
          "end": 3909
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它不是提醒，是限制。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3911,
          "end": 3911
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "白灯火焰骤然一缩，岩洞外的雪雾向内翻涌。三道铜线同时震动，叶观澜被逼退半步。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3913,
          "end": 3913
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗的人来了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3915,
          "end": 3915
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "洞外传来灰袍修士的声音：“陆照临，交还残印，宗门可保你筑基。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3917,
          "end": 3917
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜冷笑：“你们什么时候学会替人许诺境界？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3919,
          "end": 3919
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“太虚遗脉已经标记他。没有宗门护持，他活不过金丹劫。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3921,
          "end": 3921
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向陆照临：“你感觉如何？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3923,
          "end": 3923
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临检查经脉。寒流已经退去，气海却比原先沉重许多。那一缕灵气不再散开，稳稳停在气海中央，像一粒冰珠。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3925,
          "end": 3925
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“炼气三层。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3927,
          "end": 3927
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“只是一层？”叶观澜问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3929,
          "end": 3929
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“借来的火，能留下多少已经算多。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3931,
          "end": 3931
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "洞外剑光划过雪幕。玄霄宗弟子开始破阵，铜线一根根崩断。白灯仍悬在岩洞中，火焰没有受到影响。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3933,
          "end": 3933
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“毁灯会让城塌。”叶观澜提醒。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4149,
          "end": 4149
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“城塌，总比让它拿走更多名字好。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4151,
          "end": 4151
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "库房门被撞了一下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4153,
          "end": 4153
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "玄霄宗弟子的声音从外面传来：“顾长离，交还顾氏旧印。陆照临，交还两枚残印。宗门只追究主犯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4155,
          "end": 4155
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把薄册塞进怀里：“他们把我算作从犯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4157,
          "end": 4157
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临拔出短刀：“你要走哪条路？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4159,
          "end": 4159
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她指向库房后方：“旧库有一条运灯道，通往北境雪原。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4161,
          "end": 4161
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你记得？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4163,
          "end": 4163
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我记得入口。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4165,
          "end": 4165
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“里面呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4167,
          "end": 4167
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“进去之后再想。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-074",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4169,
          "end": 4169
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜推开后墙木板，露出一条向下的石阶。石阶两侧嵌着许多空灯槽，最深处却有一盏青灯亮着。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-075",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4171,
          "end": 4171
        }
      }
    ],
